		height: 36px;
		background-color: #F5F5F5;
		border-radius: 6px;
	}

	.search-icon {
		width: 14px;
		height: 14px;
		border: 2px solid #999;
		border-radius: 50%;
		position: relative;
		margin-right: 6px;
	}

	.search-icon-i2 {
		position: absolute;
		bottom: -3px;
		right: -3px;
